<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαισθ-άνομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have a perception</i> or <i>feeling of,</i> c. gen.
			objecti, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶν Ὀδυσσέως ἐπῃσθόμην;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1296
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφῆς τῆς ἐμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1351
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1183
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Nat.</u>
					14.10
				</span></i>
			; esp. of symptoms of disease, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα σαθρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					11.14
				</span></i>
			: hence abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τι τῷ σώματι</span>”
				<i>to be indisposed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					52.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.,
				<i>perceive,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				85
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					553
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				2.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν σὸν μόρον ἐ.</span>
			<i>hear of</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				996
			</span></i>: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῄσθετ᾽ ἐκ θεοῦ καλούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1629
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσθέντα δ᾽ αὐτὸν ὡς ἐπῃσθόμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					420
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>become sensible, recover one's senses,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>.</div>
